      "text": "INT. KITCHEN - CONTINUOUS\n\n[Approx. Timestamp: 00:01:30]\nEmma pours water. The whisper again—closer, like breath on her neck.\n\nWHISPER (O.S.)\n...stay...\n\nEmma spins. Nothing. She laughs nervously.\n\nEMMA\nOld house. Just the wind.\n\nShe heads upstairs.\n",
